>>1) How high can a weapon be enchanted?
>	Pretty high, but at the higher levels (greater than, say, 7) 
>	the odds of the weapon exploding become unbearably high.

+5 safely. Any higher and you have a 2/3 chance of evaporating the
weapon. Use blessed scrolls if you go past +5.

>>2) Could I wish for a "blessed magic lamp" and get it?
>	No, and what would be the point? You'd now have a portable
>	wish, which I guess is better than one now... but no.

The only thing you can wish for which may give you wishes are blessed
glowing potions. Something to remember if glowing potions are gain
ability or gain level in your game.

>>   Do they always give wishes?
>	Yes, eventually

	NO! Only if blessed.

