>	three times (counting the initial charge (I think)

Wrong again. Anything can only be recharged ONCE. This obviously
includes WoW.

Maximum wishes = 3 (you may get only 1 or 2 here)
               + 3 (after recharge)
               + 1 (repeated zapping)
